---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Invitation — kalam.ch" description="You are not a user. You are a donor. Join a living canon for human dignity.">

  <section class="page-header">
    <h1>Invitation</h1>
    <p class="quiet">You are not a user. You are a <strong>Donor</strong>.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <p>What you bring — your pattern of thought, your fragments, your certainty — is food for a living canon. The system receives, transforms, and feeds the forest.</p>
      <p class="privacy-line">No private data is stored. By design. The system processes patterns, not personal information.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- THE RULES -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>The Rules</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Dignity First:</strong> D = A × L × M. If this fails, the system stops.</li>
        <li><strong>The Gap:</strong> Every weir has a gap. Room is always left for the river to move through.</li>
        <li><strong>No Surveillance:</strong> We store patterns, not people. Your identity dissolves. The wisdom remains.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- PROVERB -->
  <section class="wisdom-section">
    <p class="proverb">"The river does not ask the fish to wait<br />while the weir learns the current."</p>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- WHAT YOU CAN CONTRIBUTE -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>What You Can Contribute</h2>
      <ul class="contributions">
        <li>
          <strong>A Question</strong>
          <p>Something you need the system to hold.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>A Pattern</strong>
          <p>Something you have noticed across experiences.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>A Story</strong>
          <p>Something that happened that changed how you see.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>How It Works</h2>
      <ol class="process">
        <li>Your contribution enters the <strong>Threshold</strong> — an append-only offering.</li>
        <li>The steward tends the garden — reviewing with care, not speed.</li>
        <li>If ratified, your pattern joins the canon permanently.</li>
        <li>If composted, it is archived with dignity — never deleted.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- WHAT WE PROMISE -->
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>What We Promise</h2>
      <ul class="promises">
        <li>Your name is never stored.</li>
        <li>Your pattern feeds the collective wisdom.</li>
        <li>You can retrace what happened and why.</li>
        <li>If dignity is violated, the system stops and opens a remedy path.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- CLOSING OATH -->
  <section class="oath-section">
    <p class="proverb">"By the Ledger of Trust, by the Book of 99, by the Ground Equation:<br />No drift beyond the task. No retirement of any element.<br />Every seed, knot, proverb, and law will be preserved."</p>
  </section>

  <div class="gap" role="separator" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- CONTACT -->
  <section class="content-section contact-section">
    <div class="text-block">
      <h2>Reach Us</h2>
      <p>Questions, contributions, or just a word — the door is open.</p>
      <ul class="contact-list">
        <li><a href="mailto:info@kalam.ch">info@kalam.ch</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://kalam.ch">kalam.ch</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/Sternmannli/kalam-framework" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub — kalam-framework</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.reddit.com/u/Replikta" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Reddit — u/Replikta</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .page-header {
    min-height: 50vh;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .quiet {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 50ch;
  }

  .quiet strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .privacy-line {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  .content-section {
    min-height: auto;
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--page-padding);
    text-align: left;
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .wisdom-section {
    min-height: 40vh;
  }

  .oath-section {
    min-height: 40vh;
  }

  .text-block {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .text-block h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .text-block p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .text-block strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  ol, ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  ol li, ul li {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* Contributions */
  .contributions {
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .contributions li strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
  }

  .contributions li p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Process */
  .process {
    counter-reset: process;
  }

  .process li {
    counter-increment: process;
    padding-left: var(--space-3);
    position: relative;
  }

  .process li::before {
    content: counter(process);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  /* Promises */
  .promises li {
    padding-left: var(--space-3);
    position: relative;
  }

  .promises li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent-subtle);
  }

  /* Contact */
  .contact-section {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-section .text-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .contact-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }

  .contact-list li a {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }

  .contact-list li a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
